    cineris-tui app::tests::screen::a_reasoning_kept_only_in_part_is_read_whole_from_its_item

[break] reasoning-runs-all-numbered-the-first
rule: Each reasoning block of a response knows which of its item's reasoning runs it is.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/app/items.rs
in: Mapper::delta
find: run: response.reasonings.len()
replace: run: 0
caught-by:
